# A snapshot copy of the design_dna repository is never source, and never enters
# git. The live route is the `design_dna` symlink beside this file, which resolves
# to the working repository; a copied folder ages silently and then reads as
# authoritative. One such copy sat here from 2026-08-05 to 2026-08-13 and had
# already diverged across 107 files.
design_dna.stale-copy-*/
design_dna-copy*/
